From 0842e75be6c484cb98a005af79ecd3d9598b94d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:17:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] LineageParts: Use the RavenOS glass theme

LineageParts pages open from Settings, so draw them like the RavenOS
glass Settings:

- Use a dark DeviceDefault base on the raven_backdrop window background,
  with transparent status, navigation and action bars, and read every
  color from res/values/raven_glass.xml (the same names as in Settings),
  so a product overlay recolors both apps the same way.
- Add GlassGroupDecoration (as in Settings) and attach it in
  SettingsPreferenceFragment, so each preference group is one rounded
  glass card with inset separators in a centred column, on every page.
- Turn the switch bar into a glass card that tints with the accent when
  on, and tint switches with the accent.
- Show category titles in raven_fg_3 and keep dialogs on a solid
  raven_surface.
- Drop the night-only switch bar override that made its label black.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ia667a6e9b4ddf380ff8b33654db8b1aa1d807aa3
